## Scenario

The admin shell of a Tuff team workspace. Workspace navigation runs down the left; the top bar holds the current location, a page filter, the ⌘K command palette, notifications and the account menu; the main area is an overview dashboard. Switching sections swaps only the main area — the shell itself stays put. The second style, Top-nav console, folds the navigation into two rows across the top, gives the full width to a project grid, and switches product and workspace from the global bar.

It suits any desktop or web back office that needs navigation, global commands and notifications together: a plugin store console, a team dashboard, an operations workbench.

